so, I don't know anything

00:00:03.499 --> 00:00:04.334
about World of Warcraft.

00:00:04.334 --> 00:00:05.835
How do I do the charge attack?

00:00:05.835 --> 00:00:06.294
- One.

00:00:06.294 --> 00:00:08.004
- OK, tell me when I can do this—

00:00:08.004 --> 00:00:08.713
- Oh, nah, now my man—

00:00:08.713 --> 00:00:09.297
- I'm getting third-partied, dude.

00:00:09.297 --> 00:00:10.757
- Yeah, my man third-partied
you and now—

00:00:10.757 --> 00:00:11.382
