00:04:20.214 --> 00:04:22.925
- Turtle Beach and Maxnomic
gave me the chair, so.

00:04:22.925 --> 00:04:23.759
It's very comfortable.

00:04:23.759 --> 00:04:24.594
It's cozy.

00:04:24.594 --> 00:04:25.553
