00:04:33.894 --> 00:04:35.688
I'm just like, "Hey, yeah, snipin'."

00:04:36.689 --> 00:04:37.982
- Do you know about this, though?

00:04:37.982 --> 00:04:38.899
Do you know what this is?

00:04:38.899 --> 00:04:41.527
- Bro, when I tell you I know nothing—

00:04:41.527 --> 00:04:42.361
- [Censor:] You don't know
what this is right here?

00:04:42.361 --> 00:04:43.195
- [Josh:] I know nothing.

00:04:43.195 --> 00:04:45.865
I mean, that's something
that helps with the sound.

00:04:45.865 --> 00:04:46.699
This is what I learned:

00:04:46.699 --> 00:04:49.910
Like, PC gamers, they're so particular

00:04:49.910 --> 00:04:52.371
with all the, like, the specs and the keyboard,

00:04:52.371 --> 00:04:53.789
