00:05:03.966 --> 00:05:06.052
So I was doin' stuff on my laptop.

00:05:06.052 --> 00:05:08.179
So, honestly, last
night was the first time

00:05:08.179 --> 00:05:12.224
I got back, like,
on to, like, this actual setup.

00:05:12.224 --> 00:05:15.603
As you can see, still getting
used to my New Orleans life.

00:05:16.896 --> 00:05:20.149
- So, how difficult is it for
you to go from console to PC?

00:05:20.149 --> 00:05:22.151
