retrain your fingers

00:05:25.237 --> 00:05:26.614
to move that kinda way.

00:05:26.614 --> 00:05:27.907
Like, you're way more accurate
with a mouse and keyboard

00:05:27.907 --> 00:05:30.242
than you are with
joysticks on a controller.

00:05:30.242 --> 00:05:34.080
I've been grindin' on WoW,
tryin' to, like, get my PC wave goin'.

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:36.749
It takes a little while, but I like it.

00:05:36.749 --> 00:05:37.750
It's more accurate.

00:05:38.709 --> 00:05:41.212
- I'm a PC noob, so I've never played PC

00:05:41.212 --> 00:05:42.046
other than RuneScape and
MapleStory when I was a kid.

00:05:42.046 --> 00:05:43.547
- Hey, we're in the same,
we're in the same, my brother.

00:05:43.547 --> 00:05:44.674
- [Censor:] World of Warcraft, though.

00:05:44.674 --> 00:05:46.634
I've never played this game either.

00:05:46.634 --> 00:05:48.010
- You know, I mean, I like sports.

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:50.680
I like first-person shooters, CoD,

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:51.931
ya know, Fortnite.

00:05:51.931 --> 00:05:55.351
