really liking this game.

00:05:55.351 --> 00:05:57.603
There's so many different
kinda players you can be.

00:05:57.603 --> 00:05:59.313
So, there's two sides—
Hordes and the Alliance.

00:05:59.313 --> 00:06:00.272
So I'm a Horde.

00:06:00.272 --> 00:06:02.316
And, like, you're just tryna
to quest, level up.

00:06:02.316 --> 00:06:03.984
You can PvP against people.

00:06:03.984 --> 00:06:05.277
- And this is your guy right here?

00:06:05.277 --> 00:06:06.112
- Yeah, that's my dude.

00:06:06.112 --> 00:06:07.363
My little Orc warrior.

00:06:07.363 --> 00:06:09.156
The name of the game is if you find stuff,

00:06:09.156 --> 00:06:10.032
