00:06:10.032 --> 00:06:13.953
So, I'm just, like, run up, and
we're just goin' blow for blow.

00:06:13.953 --> 00:06:14.829
- Can we do that right now?

00:06:14.829 --> 00:06:15.663
- All right.

00:06:15.663 --> 00:06:16.497
- [Censor:] I wanna see.

00:06:18.082 --> 00:06:19.041
What is that?!

00:06:19.041 --> 00:06:20.167
- That's my little charge.

00:06:20.167 --> 00:06:22.086
- Little charge? You just
Usain Bolt'd that thing!

00:06:22.086 --> 00:06:23.212
- I'm a big charge guy.

00:06:25.297 --> 00:06:26.799
