00:06:28.551 --> 00:06:31.721
I'm nothing crazy, cuz, like,
I'll play this and then.

00:06:31.721 --> 00:06:32.638
[Growling sound]

00:06:32.638 --> 00:06:33.639
Got a cougar.

00:06:33.639 --> 00:06:34.765
