00:06:34.765 --> 00:06:35.599
Slice him!

00:06:35.599 --> 00:06:36.809
[Slashing sounds]

00:06:36.809 --> 00:06:38.352
- [Mocking laughter]

00:06:38.352 --> 00:06:39.770
- All right, so now what
we're gonna do, Josh,

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:42.231
we're gonna play Never Have
I Ever: Gaming Edition.

00:06:42.231 --> 00:06:42.777
- OK.

00:06:42.777 --> 00:06:44.108
So every single time
I ask you one of these,

00:06:44.108 --> 00:06:45.651
