00:06:48.738 --> 00:06:53.242
Never have I ever used a
cheat code in a video game.

00:06:53.242 --> 00:06:56.245
[Rattling noise]

00:06:56.245 --> 00:06:57.329
- [Laughing]

00:06:57.329 --> 00:06:58.122
What game was it?

00:06:58.122 --> 00:06:58.956
- GTA.

00:06:58.956 --> 00:07:00.040
- Yeah, yo, me too.

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:00.875
- You gotta, you gotta—

00:07:00.875 --> 00:07:01.709
- Yeah, you have to, man.

00:07:01.709 --> 00:07:02.918
- You gotta use with GTA.

00:07:02.918 --> 00:07:06.297
- Never have I ever stayed up
for more than 24 hours gaming.

00:07:06.297 --> 00:07:07.798
