00:07:15.931 --> 00:07:16.766
[Rattling noise]

00:07:16.766 --> 00:07:18.142
Can't even finish the question.

00:07:18.142 --> 00:07:19.560
- I got, like, videos on Twitter of me,

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:21.687
