00:08:02.478 --> 00:08:03.521
[Slashing sound]

00:08:03.521 --> 00:08:05.689
[Roaring sound]

00:08:05.689 --> 00:08:07.107
See, that's the worst part.

00:08:09.151 --> 00:08:10.861
- Who is the best gamer in the NBA?

00:08:10.861 --> 00:08:15.199
- Um, Fortnite, me,
PUBG, I think Ben Simmons

00:08:15.199 --> 00:08:17.743
is big on PUBG, WoW, probably me

00:08:17.743 --> 00:08:19.620
cuz I think I'm the only
one that really plays WoW.

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:20.579
- 2K, Madden?

00:08:20.579 --> 00:08:22.498
- I don't even know cuz
I don't even play 2K.

00:08:22.498 --> 00:08:23.582
- De'Aaron said the same thing too.

00:08:23.582 --> 00:08:24.959
Most players I don't think play 2K.

00:08:24.959 --> 00:08:26.752
- Yeah, a lot of players don't play 2K.

00:08:26.752 --> 00:08:27.586
- Call of Duty?

00:08:27.586 --> 00:08:28.796
- CoD, I'll probably say De'Aaron.

00:08:28.796 --> 00:08:30.673
- You're the best Call of
Duty player in the NBA?

00:08:30.673 --> 00:08:31.507
- Not even close.

00:08:31.507 --> 00:08:33.342
- You're claiming right now
on camera, this is official,

00:08:33.342 --> 00:08:36.095
that you are the best NBA
player that plays Call of Duty?

00:08:36.095 --> 00:08:38.305
- I believe I am the best
player in sports, to be honest.

00:08:38.305 --> 00:08:40.015
- Do you play video games
with any other athletes?

00:08:40.015 --> 00:08:40.850
- Yeah.

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:42.768
When I played Fortnite,

00:08:42.768 --> 00:08:45.271
I had like this Twitch
stream I did on Sundays

00:08:45.271 --> 00:08:47.898
and it was called Ballers
Only, and it was fun.

00:08:47.898 --> 00:08:50.109
I played with NBA guys, I
played with soccer guys,

00:08:50.109 --> 00:08:51.819
um, football guys,

00:08:51.819 --> 00:08:54.280
I played with Karl-Anthony
Towns, Larry Nance,

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:55.406
Reggie Jackson,

00:08:55.406 --> 00:08:58.242
Terrence Ross, Rondae Hollis-Jefferson.

00:08:58.242 --> 00:09:02.413
It's cool just because it's a
different side of the athlete.

00:09:02.413 --> 00:09:03.330
I think that's probably why

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:05.165
me and Larry Nance have
such a good relationship,

00:09:05.165 --> 00:09:09.253
just cuz we play video games for hours.

00:09:09.253 --> 00:09:10.087
[Man:] Quick dubs, quick dubs.

00:09:10.087 --> 00:09:13.007
[Other man:] Quick dubs!

00:09:13.007 --> 00:09:14.049
- [Man:] Squad dubs.

00:09:14.049 --> 00:09:15.259
- I can't tell you how many hours

00:09:15.259 --> 00:09:16.886
we probably played together,
playing video games.

00:09:16.886 --> 00:09:19.805
Now, when you're on the court,
you know, it's always business,

00:09:19.805 --> 00:09:21.307
but when you get off the court, ya know,

00:09:21.307 --> 00:09:22.182
you play video games,

00:09:22.182 --> 00:09:23.767
you kind of dive into their personal life,

00:09:23.767 --> 00:09:25.519
you're able to see people
in different lights,

00:09:25.519 --> 00:09:27.771
and you're able to have a better
chemistry with those guys,

00:09:27.771 --> 00:09:29.440
and that even transfers onto the court,

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:32.985
so, anyone who want to get
their ass whupped, holla at me.

00:09:33.903 --> 00:09:34.987
♪ Tell me when to go ♪

00:09:34.987 --> 00:09:35.988
♪ Tell me when to go ♪

00:09:35.988 --> 00:09:36.906
♪ Tell me when to go ♪

00:09:36.906 --> 00:09:38.115
♪ Tell me when to go ♪

00:09:38.115 --> 00:09:38.949
[Smacking sound]

00:09:38.949 --> 00:09:40.910
[Laughing]

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:41.785
I might be able to--

00:09:41.785 --> 00:09:42.620
I'm at level 28, but,

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:45.956
I might be able to get this
level 30 Sparkleshell Tortoise.

00:09:45.956 --> 00:09:46.999
- [Censor:] Yo, he's chasing you.
- [Josh:] He's chasing me.

00:09:46.999 --> 00:09:49.293
- Run, run, he's gonna get you.

00:09:49.293 --> 00:09:50.336
- He's gonna get me.

00:09:50.336 --> 00:09:51.170
Aaaah he's gonna kill me!

00:09:52.379 --> 00:09:54.632
[Fanfare sounds]

00:09:54.632 --> 00:09:57.009
So, this is what happens when you die.

00:09:57.009 --> 00:09:58.594
- One last thing before we go.

00:09:58.594 --> 00:09:59.428
I have a surprise for you.

00:09:59.428 --> 00:10:00.471
My crew set something up for you.

00:10:00.471 --> 00:10:01.764
- Cool, cool, let's do it.

00:10:03.265 --> 00:10:05.142
That was just so perfectly on cue.

00:10:06.352 --> 00:10:07.269
- [Censor:] There it is.

00:10:07.269 --> 00:10:08.187
- This is dope.

00:10:08.187 --> 00:10:09.897
- We got the old school Space Invaders.

00:10:09.897 --> 00:10:12.066
We want to know if you can
beat my high score, dude.

00:10:12.066 --> 00:10:12.900
You ready to go?

00:10:12.900 --> 00:10:13.734
- [Josh:] Let's do it.

00:10:13.734 --> 00:10:15.069
- [Censor:] Have you played
Space Invaders before?

00:10:15.069 --> 00:10:16.403
- It's been a long time.

00:10:16.403 --> 00:10:18.238
- Okay, let's see what you got, Josh.

00:10:19.198 --> 00:10:20.032
Oh.

00:10:20.032 --> 00:10:21.742
- [Josh:] Oh, nah, look.

00:10:21.742 --> 00:10:23.243
I literally looked up at the score.

00:10:23.243 --> 00:10:25.204
I was like, all right, what score is it?

00:10:26.163 --> 00:10:27.039
- Oh, you might,

00:10:27.039 --> 00:10:28.207
you might get this, dude.

00:10:28.207 --> 00:10:29.917
Can you knock them all out?

00:10:29.917 --> 00:10:30.834
- [Josh:] Ooo!

00:10:30.834 --> 00:10:32.461
- You got one last life, one last life.

00:10:32.461 --> 00:10:33.796
You're getting really close, dude.

00:10:33.796 --> 00:10:34.630
- [Josh:] Oh my god.

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:36.423
The pressure's on, man.

00:10:36.423 --> 00:10:37.257
One.

00:10:38.258 --> 00:10:39.468
Ah, you got it.

00:10:39.468 --> 00:10:40.469
- But I got the high score!

00:10:40.469 --> 00:10:41.887
You got the new high score, though!

00:10:41.887 --> 00:10:42.721
I got the high score!

00:10:42.721 --> 00:10:43.806
- It was a pleasure, man.

00:10:43.806 --> 00:10:44.640
- Ah, thank you, man.

00:10:44.640 --> 00:10:45.474
- Thanks again, dude.

00:10:45.474 --> 00:10:46.642
All right, I'll see you later, man.

00:10:46.642 --> 00:10:47.601
- Bye.

00:10:47.601 --> 00:10:49.019
As you walk off into the sunset.

00:10:49.019 --> 00:10:49.853
- [Censor:] Yup.

00:10:56.694 --> 00:10:58.112
- Hey, I'm Josh Hart.

00:10:58.112 --> 00:10:59.905
Thank you guys for
watching Battlestations.

00:10:59.905 --> 00:11:02.533
Make sure you guys subscribe
to the Bleacher Report channel.

